-        "CoDOL linked ps: client %u server %d cmd %d pm_type %d ground %d (eType %d tr %d) "
-        "parent %d (eType %d tr %d time %d dur %d delta %.2f %.2f %.2f) origin (%.3f %.3f %.3f) "
